                "entry_id": "6a8c7bce-beff-34a5-bf09-894a8ca40a71",
                "word": "fugu",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "46dc7adc-7467-4729-8db4-90d742e5e00e",
                        "entry_id": "6a8c7bce-beff-34a5-bf09-894a8ca40a71",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "fugus"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9fab2f68-1e67-37be-959c-82a354083a06",
                        "entry_id": "6a8c7bce-beff-34a5-bf09-894a8ca40a71",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Poisson du genre Takifugu, tétrodon connu pour provoquer de très graves intoxications à la tétrodotoxine."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dcb474b7-d77a-462e-8812-0e91a5c4bbd8",
                                "sense_id": "9fab2f68-1e67-37be-959c-82a354083a06",
                                "text": "Les tripes du fugu renferment du poison mortel. Mais crue, sa chair translucide permet de réaliser de véritables œuvres d’art."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "979499c1-d14b-4bf8-aa55-472801d4d3db",
                                "sense_id": "9fab2f68-1e67-37be-959c-82a354083a06",
                                "text": "Le fugu est un poisson à la chair blanche et délicate, très apprécié en sashimi."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "86f407d7-112f-42e4-92bc-9d5e333c9ab7",
                                "sense_id": "9fab2f68-1e67-37be-959c-82a354083a06",
                                "text": "Lorsque nous nous lançons dans un projet d’écriture, que nous créons une histoire avec nos mots, une sorte de substance toxique, tapie au plus profond de chaque être humain, ressort à la surface, que cela nous plaise ou non. Tous les écrivains ont à faire face, plus ou moins, à ce principe délétère et, conscients du danger qu’il recèle, doivent se débrouiller pour transiger avec. Car autrement, il n’y aurait aucune activité créatrice, dans son sens véritable. (Désolé pour cette étrange analogie : dans le poisson que l’on appelle « fugu », la partie la plus délicate au goût est la plus proche du poison - une similitude sans doute significative)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2992a0d2-c71f-4f36-a021-9fdf9b54cc9e",
                                "sense_id": "9fab2f68-1e67-37be-959c-82a354083a06",
                                "text": "Pour retirer la toxine du fugu, il faut enlever notamment le foie, les intestins et les gonades."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "de6cbed2-3d54-45a2-9fc9-bea7a6859be7",
                        "source_entry_id": "6a8c7bce-beff-34a5-bf09-894a8ca40a71",
                        "source_sense_id": "9fab2f68-1e67-37be-959c-82a354083a06",
                        "target_lang_word": "fugu",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fugu",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "512b87f8-e927-3376-ae41-66400a7f7e49",
                                        "entry_id": "231612f1-aa7b-3e33-8d99-cb9e4a768370",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Blowfish: a delicacy popular in Japan served raw as sushi that may, if improperly prepared, contain deadly levels of neurotoxins."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "15c4bb7a-0d97-4b9f-b708-056fb44f8244",
                                                "sense_id": "512b87f8-e927-3376-ae41-66400a7f7e49",
                                                "text": "Twenty minutes later, the chef has successfully prepared a whole fugu—or puffer fish—a Japanese delicacy whose capacity to maim and kill is dividing the country’s culinary world."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "36db205f-75f2-448e-b537-ea7e44ef01ff",
                                                "sense_id": "512b87f8-e927-3376-ae41-66400a7f7e49",
                                                "text": "A sluggish swimmer, fugu has stunted fins and often flat-lying spikes instead of scales, and when confronted by predators it compensates for its lack of speed by swallowing enough water to swell up until its spikes stand on end, so it looks like an angry armored balloon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b8202e49-6920-470e-a503-b5e8ae53cb87",
                        "source_entry_id": "6a8c7bce-beff-34a5-bf09-894a8ca40a71",
                        "source_sense_id": "9fab2f68-1e67-37be-959c-82a354083a06",
                        "target_lang_word": "blowfish",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "blowfish",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "17112eaa-26b9-3803-b726-63535e4d17df",
                                        "entry_id": "16418926-897a-3b76-abbc-dcf8c355eeb5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any species of fish of the family Tetraodontidae that have the ability to inflate themselves to a globe several times their normal size by swallowing water or air when threatened."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4380722c-983a-4025-a5d2-1787551ec029",
                                                "sense_id": "17112eaa-26b9-3803-b726-63535e4d17df",
                                                "text": "Where the waves wish-wash, and the foghorn blows, And the blowfish nibble at your toes - oes - oes, The blowfish nibble at your toes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a302c865-95d3-3b5b-a99b-95730084487e",
                                        "entry_id": "16418926-897a-3b76-abbc-dcf8c355eeb5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A delicacy popular in Japan, consisting of the fish served raw as sushi or perhaps fried. It may, if improperly prepared, contain considerably deadly levels of neurotoxins."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "633f33b8-1709-4958-8560-9c3ae80b40e4",
                                                "sense_id": "a302c865-95d3-3b5b-a99b-95730084487e",
                                                "text": "Fugu, the blowfish or globefish, offers taste, health and adventure in every bite."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
